<title>UK: Domino says bought back shares at 319p.</title>
<headline>Domino says bought back shares at 319p.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Domino Printing Sciences Plc said on Friday it had bought back just over 1.12 million of its own shares at 319 pence each during Thursday.</p>
<p>The buyback represented some 4.2 percent of its issued share capital, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
